  {
    "hotel_id": "284620",
    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/d-eastern-hotel/hotel/ipoh-my.html",
    "name": "D Eastern Hotel",
    "detail": " We didn't expect our hotel experience to be so good, given the price! Our bus arrived in Ipoh 2 hours early and just as we thought we would be stranded at the bus station, a call to D Eastern's front desk revealed that we can check-in as early as 830am because a room was already available. Wow, which other hotel does that?! Not any that I know of! We stayed there for 3 nights. The first thing my friend and I did was to ask for their Wifi password (we were on holiday but still needed internet for survival haha) and the internet connection in the room was stable and fast. We requested for extra pillows which was given to us at no extra charge. They also replenished our bottled water daily because we drank like horses. We bumped into the cleaning lady and she was so sweet. She also made our beds very nicely. We asked the staff to recommend us some attractions in Ipoh and we followed their advice. A money changer and a conveniece store is located right beside the hotel's restaurant. We weren't aware that the hotel had a restaurant, because it said on most websites that they were in the process of making one. The breakfast buffet is local food. For RM 7, you can eat to your heart's content. But we prefered the ala carte offerings which are only available for lunch and dinner. To give you an estimation of the cost, one plate of fried rice costs about RM4 and if you want something fancier like lamb chop that will cost you RM8. The prices are so reasonable that for some of our meals, we decided to just eat at the hotel's restaurant instead of venturing out. We would definitely come back to stay at Ipoh hotel. The only negative was that the rooms have no safety deposit boxes so we carried our light valuables around. Still though, I think you can ask the front desk to help you store some valuables which you don't want to carry with you. Early check out is possible too at this hotel. We highly recommend it!",
